BlueIce fixture corpus -- additions curated specifically for Phase 15's
Chromium differential harness. They remain ordinary shared #data fixtures:
the browser-independent oracle checks their live DOM/screenshot result, while
other pipeline-stage tests can add their own sections later without a second
corpus or format.

#data
<div id="target">before</div>
<script>
const target = document.querySelector('#target');
target.textContent = 'script-ran';
</script>

